"「隱藏既有實例」必須與「隱藏」一起開啟（範本：%s）。若隱藏既有實例、範本卻仍"
"上架在應用市集，租戶會買到一個自己看不到也管不了的服務。要上架就把兩個開關都"
"關掉。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/migrations/18.0.1.0.140/pre-migrate.py:0
msgid ""
"#519: several cloud_service rows point at the same subscription, so the "
"`woow_paas_cloud_service_subscription_uniq` unique index cannot be created.\n"
"\n"
"%(detail)s\n"
"\n"
"Decide which service each subscription really belongs to, then re-provision "
"or delete the rest. Do NOT clear subscription_id to NULL - that would detach "
"those services from the suspension / billing cron for good."
msgstr ""
"#519: 有多筆 cloud_service 指向同一筆訂閱，因此無法建立 "
"`woow_paas_cloud_service_subscription_uniq` 唯一索引。\n"
"\n"
"%(detail)s\n"
"\n"
"請先確認每筆訂閱真正屬於哪一筆服務，其餘的重新開通或刪除。請勿把 "
"subscription_id 清成 NULL——那會讓這些服務永久脫離停權／計費 cron 的管理。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/migrations/18.0.1.0.144/post-migrate.py:0
msgid ""
"#744: the Access policy anchors did not land as an exclusive arc.\n"
"\n"
"%(detail)s\n"
"\n"
"This migration moves no data, so a failure here means a step of the upgrade "
"failed silently. Resolve it before re-running the upgrade."
msgstr ""
"#744: Access policy 的錨點沒有落成 exclusive arc。\n"
"\n"
"%(detail)s\n"
"\n"
"這個 migration 不搬動任何資料，因此這裡失敗代表升級過程中有某個步驟靜默失敗"
"了。請先排除問題，再重跑升級。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_paas_platform.field_woow_paas_platform_security_access_access_policy_rule__cloud_service_id
msgid "#744：父 policy 的另一半錨點，同樣 store=True 讓 ir.rule 走得到。"
msgstr ""

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/migrations/18.0.1.0.150/post-migrate.py:0
msgid ""
"#768: the Smart Home Access anchors (the three-legged policy arc plus "
"smart_home_route) did not land correctly.\n"
"\n"
"%(detail)s\n"
"\n"
"This migration only creates route rows and moves no strings, so a failure "
"here means a step of the upgrade failed silently. Resolve it before re-"
"running the upgrade."
msgstr ""
"#768: Smart Home Access 的錨點（三腿 policy arc 加上 smart_home_route）沒有正"
"確落地。\n"
"\n"
"%(detail)s\n"
"\n"
"這個 migration 只建立 route 資料列、不搬動任何字串，因此這裡失敗代表升級過程"
"中有某個步驟靜默失敗了。請先排除問題，再重跑升級。"

