#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/sh_subscription_fix.py:0
msgid ""
"%(n)s in_progress subscription(s) are more than %(days)s days past due and "
"were not touched by any billing path during that time "
"(woow_last_payment_failure_at was never updated).\n"
"Oldest one: %(name)s (next_payment=%(np)s).\n"
"Supporting data: %(inv)s cycle invoice(s) created in the last %(days)s "
"days.\n"
"Likely causes: the base auto-invoice cron was disabled (#778 collision), or "
"handling of those subscriptions keeps raising an exception that is being "
"swallowed."
msgstr ""
"有 %(n)s 筆 in_progress 訂閱逾期超過 %(days)s 天，且這段期間沒有任何計費路徑"
"碰過它們（woow_last_payment_failure_at 從未更新）。\n"
"最舊的一筆：%(name)s（next_payment=%(np)s）。\n"
"佐證資料：最近 %(days)s 天內新建的 cycle invoice 共 %(inv)s 張。\n"
"可能原因：base auto-invoice cron 被停用（#778 衝突），或處理這些訂閱時持續拋"
"出例外而被吞掉。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/account_move_invoice_status.py:0
msgid ""
"%(n)s posted invoice(s) have been waiting more than %(days)s days for a "
"manual ECPay e-invoice and still have no invoice number.\n"
"Oldest one: %(name)s (created %(created)s).\n"
"Issue them from the invoice form (\"Retry ECPay e-invoice\"), or switch the "
"company's \"Issue e-invoice\" setting to automatic.\n"
"Note: woow_invoice_issue_state='issued' is NOT proof of issuance "
"(ecpay_demo_mode defaults to True); the ECPay invoice number is."
msgstr ""
"有 %(n)s 張已過帳的帳單等待人工開立 ECPay 電子發票逾 %(days)s "
"天，仍未取得發票號碼。\n"
"最舊的一張：%(name)s（建立於 %(created)s）。\n"
"請從帳單表單開立（「Retry ECPay e-invoice」），或把公司的「Issue "
"e-invoice」設定改為自動。\n"
"注意：woow_invoice_issue_state='issued' "
"不能當成已開立的證明（ecpay_demo_mode 預設為 True），ECPay 發票號碼才是。"

