msgstr ""

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/security_access_access_policy.py:0
msgid ""
"Allow policy %r cannot use %s as an Include rule.\n"
"\n"
"Why: seat-based Access plans count people by the addresses listed in 'Email "
"list' rules, so a whole-domain, everyone, IP-range or country rule admits "
"an unlimited number of people while counting as zero. Every one of them "
"still draws on the Cloudflare Access seat pool shared by the whole "
"platform, and once that pool is exhausted the next login is refused — for "
"every tenant, not just this one.\n"
"What to use instead: list the individual addresses in an 'Email list' "
"Include rule. To narrow (not widen) access you can still use these "
"selectors in Require / Exclude rules, and Block policies are unaffected. "
"Bypass policies are exempt because they skip authentication and therefore "
"consume no seat."
msgstr ""
"Allow policy %r 不可以用 %s 當作包含規則。\n"
"\n"
"原因：按席次計費的 Access 方案是以「Email 清單」規則中列出的位址來計算人數，"
"因此整個網域、「所有人」、IP 範圍或國家這類規則會放行無限多人，卻只被算成 0 "
"人。這些人每一位仍會佔用全平台共用的 Cloudflare Access 席位池，一旦席位池用"
"盡，下一個人登入就會被拒絕——而且是對每一個租戶生效，不只這一位。\n"
"可改用的作法：把個別位址列在「Email 清單」包含規則裡。若是要收窄（而非放寬）"
"存取範圍，這些選擇器仍可用在 Require 規則與排除規則上，Block policy 也不受影"
"響。Bypass policy 不受此限，因為它跳過驗證，不佔任何席次。"

