#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/static/src/paas/pages/smart-home/tabs/SmartHomeAccessTab.js:0
msgid ""
"Once protection is on, every visitor has to pass Access verification before "
"this address opens, including you and your own family. Only identities "
"matching an Access policy below get in; clients that never show a browser "
"login page (a phone app connecting directly, for example) are shut out."
msgstr ""
"開啟後所有訪客都需通過 Access 驗證才能開啟這條網址，包含你自己與家人。只有符"
"合下方 Access policy 的身分才進得來；不會跳出瀏覽器登入頁的用戶端（例如手機 "
"App 直連）會被擋在外面。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/static/src/paas/pages/service/tabs/AccessTab.js:0
msgid ""
"Once protection is on, every visitor must pass Access authentication before "
"this service's URL will open, including the people who can browse it "
"anonymously today. Only identities matching an Access policy below can get "
"in."
msgstr ""
"開啟後所有訪客都需通過 Access 驗證才能開啟這個服務的網址，包含目前可以匿名瀏"
"覽的人。只有符合下方 Access policy 的身分才進得來。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/static/src/paas/pages/security-access/SecurityAccessDetailPage.js:0
msgid ""
"Once protection is on, every visitor to this route's address has to pass "
"Access verification first, including you. Only identities matching an Access"
" policy below get in; clients that cannot show a browser login page (API "
"clients, webhooks, scripts or apps connecting directly) will be blocked."
msgstr ""
"開啟後所有訪客都需先通過 Access 驗證才能開啟這條 route 的網址，包含你自己。"
"只有符合下方 Access policy 的身分才進得來；無法顯示瀏覽器登入頁的用戶端（API "
"用戶端、webhook、腳本或直連的 App）會被擋在外面。"

