"Runtime Pod — but only if the platform is ready (PaaS Operator URL + API Key "
"set and a valid Default Agent Template selected above). When the platform is "
"not ready the flag stays off so a new project never lands in a guaranteed "
"spawn-failure state. Users never set this per project; it is a platform-wide "
"default decided here."
msgstr ""

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_paas_platform.field_account_bank_statement_line__woow_skip_upstream_hook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_paas_platform.field_account_move__woow_skip_upstream_hook
