"resolve the incident or send a resolution notification. Use “Mark as "
"manually resolved” to close the incident."
msgstr ""
"完成 review activity 只會略過並重新建立提醒；不會關閉 incident，也不會寄送"
"結案通知。請使用「人工已處理」關閉 incident。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
