"(not a Workspace role). It reads all incidents across all companies; review "
"activities go to all current managers in that Odoo group; no company M2O/rule; "
"base.group_system behavior is not narrowed."
msgstr ""
"帳務 incident 存取使用 Odoo role `account.group_account_manager`（不是 Workspace "
"role）；可跨全部公司讀取全部 incident，review activity 派給該 Odoo group 所有現任 "
"manager；不加 company M2O/rule，也不縮減 base.group_system 行為。"

