"Payment incidents store the raw ECPay MerchantTradeNo. Non-payment callers "
"must use a namespaced key such as `invoice:<stable-reference>`. Access belongs "
"to the Odoo role `account.group_account_manager` (not a Workspace role), which "
"reads all incidents across all companies; review activities go to all current "
"managers in that Odoo group."
msgstr ""
"付款事件保存原始 ECPay MerchantTradeNo。非付款 caller 必須使用具 namespace 的 key，例如 "
"`invoice:<stable-reference>`。存取屬於 Odoo role `account.group_account_manager`（不是 "
"Workspace role），可跨全部公司讀取全部 incident，review activity 派給該 Odoo group 所有現任 manager。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_paas_platform.field_woow_billing_incident__trade_no
msgid ""
"Provider-issued trade number (ECPay TradeNo). Only write the value the "
"payment provider gave us in its callback payload. Never store our own "
"MerchantTradeNo / payment.transaction reference here -- that belongs in "
"external_ref. When a callback arrives before the transaction is visible, "
"this column is the platform's only record of the provider-side trade "
"number."
msgstr "Provider（ECPay）配發的交易單號（TradeNo）。只寫 payment provider 在 callback payload 裡給我們的值。⛔ 不得把我方的 MerchantTradeNo／payment.transaction reference 寫進來——那屬於 external_ref。當 callback 早於 transaction 可見時，這一欄是平台唯一一份 provider 側的交易單號紀錄。"
